-- Seed batch 2 (Alex, Nov 24 2026): 150 text + 50 photo + 50 Airbnb-listing battles, 15–20 seed-user votes each.
-- Generated by scripts/gen-seed-batch-2.ts from scripts/seed-batch-2/*. Idempotent.
