  ('seed_b2_t1', 'zEqVDAAt', 'seed_b2u_11', 'He put my $90 cashmere sweater in the dryer and says ''it''s just a little smaller now''. Who''s right?', 'It fits our 8 year old niece now.', now() - interval '414 minutes', now() - interval '414 minutes' + interval '108 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t2', 'gVPnsJ65', 'seed_vu_58', 'My husband says I''m not allowed to be mad that he forgot my birthday because ''you never remind me''. Ok who''s right?', 'It''s on his phone calendar. I checked.', now() - interval '1520 minutes', now() - interval '1520 minutes' + interval '105 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t3', 'DLkWtFzt', 'seed_vu_125', 'He wants to go to his buddy''s bachelor party in Cabo the same week I''m due. Who''s right here?', 'He says first babies are always late.', now() - interval '2158 minutes', now() - interval '2158 minutes' + interval '106 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t4', 'mEd7yvWn', 'seed_vu_23', 'I want to tell my best friend before his family that we''re engaged. He thinks parents first. Who is right?', 'My best friend introduced us lol', now() - interval '98 minutes', now() - interval '98 minutes' + interval '106 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t5', 'fxUp7xNG', 'seed_b2u_5', 'My bf eats the last of everything and doesn''t put it on the list. I think that''s a crime. Who''s right??', 'Opened the fridge for creamer this morning. Empty carton. Back in the fridge.', now() - interval '3474 minutes', now() - interval '3474 minutes' + interval '103 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t6', 'UbhHfibp', 'seed_vu_12', 'He says it''s ''basically the same'' to text me happy anniversary from the golf course. Who''s right?', 'He booked the tee time 3 weeks ago. He knew.', now() - interval '3010 minutes', now() - interval '3010 minutes' + interval '117 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t7', 'DDTBCUsg', 'seed_b2u_20', 'My husband leaves exactly 1 square of toilet paper on the roll so he ''doesn''t have to change it''. So who''s right?', 'He thinks it''s hilarious. It''s been 4 years.', now() - interval '734 minutes', now() - interval '734 minutes' + interval '100 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t8', 'TTCMPunh', 'seed_lu_9', 'Fiancé wants his mom to help pick my wedding dress. I want my mom and my sister only. Who''s right?', 'His mom has already sent me 11 links.', now() - interval '3671 minutes', now() - interval '3671 minutes' + interval '118 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t9', 'LJTAQDhx', 'seed_tu_22', 'He thinks it''s fine to have his female coworker over to ''study'' for a certification while I''m at work. Who''s right here?', 'They passed. I''m still mad.', now() - interval '611 minutes', now() - interval '611 minutes' + interval '115 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t10', 'dzKUDth3', 'seed_vu_29', 'I told his mom she can''t post our ultrasound on Facebook. He says I embarrassed her. Which one of us is right?', 'She already had it typed up with 4 paragraphs.', now() - interval '140 minutes', now() - interval '140 minutes' + interval '115 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t11', 'ZFCrPSfd', 'seed_vu_68', 'My boyfriend says if I''m cold I should ''just wear a hoodie'' instead of turning up the heat. Ok who''s right?', 'I''m wearing two hoodies. It''s 64 in here.', now() - interval '1497 minutes', now() - interval '1497 minutes' + interval '117 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t12', '2HCYPeea', 'seed_vu_54', 'He spent our weekend away fixing his friend''s car. I spent it alone at a B&B. Who''s right?', 'The car was ''basically an emergency''. It was a hobby car.', now() - interval '2108 minutes', now() - interval '2108 minutes' + interval '119 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t13', 'pGBc57Uw', 'seed_tu_18', 'My husband wants a tv in the bedroom. I say no screens in the bedroom, ever. Who''s right??', 'He fell asleep to SportsCenter for 6 years before me.', now() - interval '2821 minutes', now() - interval '2821 minutes' + interval '110 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t14', 'xYJyJEhV', 'seed_vu_65', 'I asked for help with the kids'' bath and he said ''you''re better at it''. Who''s actually right?', 'I''m better at it because I''m the only one who does it.', now() - interval '1672 minutes', now() - interval '1672 minutes' + interval '105 hours'),
  ('seed_b2_t15', 'J47GF4hS', 'seed_vu_93', 'He gave my car keys to his brother without asking because ''it''s family''. Who''s right?', 'His brother returned it with no gas and a drive-thru bag.', now() - interval '796 minutes', now() - interval '796 minutes' + interval '116 hours'),
