  ('seed_b2_t24', 'AXdxmu4J', 'seed_vu_15', 'My wife wants to repaint our kitchen for the 3rd time in 2 years. I say it''s fine. Who''s right here?', 'It''s currently ''sage''. Before that ''other sage''.', now() - interval '1895 minutes', now() - interval '1895 minutes' + interval '114 hours'),
